    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to offer to the market this impressive detached home constructed by Michael Duane Builders and located fronting the exclusive Pontoon Road, a popular established residential area within 900mts of Castlebar town centre. \r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a masterfully constructed A2 rated detached dwelling which will be completed to a superior finish both internally and externally.  This property is exceptionally designed offering fully completed interior and exterior. The purchaser can avail of the opportunity to choose their own finishings benefitting from generous P.C. sums for bespoke painted kitchen , tiling,  sanitary ware , painting , interior hardwood finishes to include hardwood doors and moulded surrounds, skirting boards, top quality sanitary ware & fititngs, air to water heating and hollow core to first floor.\r\n \r\nThe property comprises 191sqm/2055sq ft on a site of 444sqm with secure bounded stone faced wall to front ,block wall to side and rear."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor accommodation comprises ; \r\nEntrance hall; 8.5sqm ; Family room;13.8m2; Livingroom-14.9m2 - Kitchen /Breakfast area - 20.7m2 -Dining area; 15.5m2: Conservatory-11.5m2-Utility 7m2- Ground floor w.c. 2.4m2.\r\nFirst floor -Hall landing -5.7m2 -Store/plant room-2.4m2 - Family bathroom - 6.2m2 - Master bedroom -18.0m2 / en-suite 7m2- Bedroom 2- 14.20m2- shower room- 4.5m2 - Bedroom 3- 12.3m2 - Bedroom 4-12.2m2\r\n\r\nFurther details, appointment to view can be made by contacting the sole selling agent Claire Flannelly 087 2548216."
      },
